      <li><a href="https://github.com/unixwin/rubash/blob/master/docs/nameref-suite-residual-gnu-race-20261012.md" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Byte-level attribution: nameref residual = GNU's own race ↗</a></li>
      <li><a href="/docs/compatibility/" hreflang="zh-CN" lang="zh-CN">Chinese edition of this page</a></li>
    </ul>
  </footer>

  <FaqSection items={pageFaq} lang="en" />
</DocsLayout>

